  "sections": {
   "install": {
    "title": "Quick Start Examples",
    "html": "<p>You can create additional files to organize your matches any way you want.<br />\nMake sure to adhere to proper YAML spacing.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">matches:\n  - trigger: \":hello\"\n    replace: \"Hi There!\"\n  - triggers: [\":test1\", \":test2\"]\n    replace: \"These both expand to the same thing\"\n</code></pre>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 281
   },
   "usage": null,
   "features": {
    "title": "Key Features",
    "html": "<ul>\n<li>Cross-platform (<strong>Windows</strong>, <strong>macOS</strong>, <strong>Linux</strong>)</li>\n<li>Privacy-first (100% local, no tracking)</li>\n<li>Works with almost <strong>any program</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Emoji</strong> support 😄</li>\n<li><strong>Image</strong> support</li>\n<li>Includes a powerful <strong>Search Bar</strong> 🔎</li>\n<li><strong>Date</strong> expansion support</li>\n<li><strong>Custom scripts</strong> support</li>\n<li><strong>Shell commands</strong> support</li>\n<li><strong>App-specific</strong> configurations</li>\n<li>Support <a href=\"https://espanso.org/docs/matches/forms/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Forms</a></li>\n<li>Expandable with <strong>packages</strong></li>\n<li>Built-in <strong>package manager</strong> for <a href=\"https://hub.espanso.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">espanso hub</a></li>\n<li>File based configuration</li>\n<li>Support Regex triggers</li>\n<li>Experimental Wayland support</li>\n<li>Written in Rust (Fast, Reliable)</li>\n</ul>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 621
   }
